Package: blogscapes
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Crossposting Openscapes Blog Content
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Ronny A.", "Hernandez Mora",
      email = "ronny.hernandezm@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides functions to crosspost blog post folders between
    Openscapes-affiliated repositories, verify that a post's images are
    self-contained before copying, and open pull requests for the
    crossposted content.
